  states otherwise.

Open GPUI currently consumes maintained forks of third-party projects including:
  open-gpui-scap, from the scap screen capture library lineage
  font-kit, from the Servo font-kit library lineage

Those forked dependencies and all other third-party dependencies retain their
own copyright notices and license terms. A release distribution should include
the applicable third-party notices generated from the resolved dependency graph.
